{"id":53210,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=53210"},"modified":"2026-10-28T08:02:14","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:02:14","slug":"corrida-das-empresas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-das-empresas\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida das Empresas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida das Empresas 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida das Empresas 2026<\/strong> (Corrida das Empresas Quir\u00f3nprevenci\u00f3n) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na frente ribeirinha oriental de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lisboa<\/strong>. Pensado para promover o esp\u00edrito de equipa, o <em>team building<\/em> e o bem-estar corporativo fora do escrit\u00f3rio, este desafio junta colegas de trabalho em equipas de 2, 3 ou 4 elementos (masculinas, femininas ou mistas) e participantes individuais ao longo de um tra\u00e7ado plano e r\u00e1pido junto ao Tejo. Prepara o ritmo da tua equipa na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explora o guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Avenida Infante Dom Henrique<\/strong>, junto ao <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Beato Innovation District<\/strong> (Hub Criativo do Beato), o evento \u00e9 composto pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>) e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:20<\/strong>). Na prova principal de 10 km, ap\u00f3s o segmento inicial na Av. Infante Dom Henrique at\u00e9 \u00e0 Rua Gualdim Pais e \u00e0 Rotunda Oval, o pelot\u00e3o entra no passeio ribeirinho do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong>, percorrendo a Rua de Cintura do Porto, a Alameda dos Oceanos, a Avenida do Mediterr\u00e2neo, a Avenida Dom Jo\u00e3o II e a Pra\u00e7a Pr\u00edncipe Perfeito antes de regressar pela ciclovia ribeirinha \u00e0 meta no Beato.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Aminhacorrida<\/strong> e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Last Lap Eventos Lda.<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o atribui a vit\u00f3ria coletiva \u00e0 equipa com o menor somat\u00f3rio de tempos de chip dos seus elementos em cada categoria (2, 3 ou 4 elementos), premiando tamb\u00e9m os vencedores individuais. Limitada a 5000 participantes, a prova assegura dorsal personalizado, medalha finisher, abastecimentos aos 5 km e na meta, diploma digital e servi\u00e7o de roupeiro gratuito.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">22 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Beato Innovation Distri